<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom yr result due noon, May 14.</title>
<headline>Telecom yr result due noon, May 14.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corporation of New Zealand will announce its financial results for the year to March 31 at noon (OOO GMT) on May 14.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
